      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get the theory behind it, but honestly, how can people say it's \"obvious\" when the cost is so insane? my textbook says the math for ubi just doesn't add up without massive tax hikes that would kill the economy. aren't the people saying ubi is the fix just ignoring the massive risk of inflation and debt?",
